        },
        {
            "id": "800606",
            "objective": "Leave the hilichurl camp",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "80060601",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "We can see the upside-down city from here, too."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060602",
                    "speaker": "Dainsleif",
                    "text": "Wait... Watch out!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060603",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Aaaah!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060604",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Wh—What's going on!? Is that light coming from the room in the center? Ow, it's too bright!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060605",
                    "speaker": "Dainsleif",
                    "text": "The mutation is continuing... Has the Abyss made its move already?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060606",
                    "speaker": "Abyss Herald",
                    "text": "Dainsleif... I see your incessant meddling continues, and that you have once again joined forces with Our Highness's kin..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060607",
                    "speaker": "Abyss Herald",
                    "text": "Regrettably, I was not in time to control your exit from the network... and it sent you here, of all places. This was a catastrophic error."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060608",
                    "speaker": "Dainsleif",
                    "text": "Hmph! I am surprised that you dare to face me. You ran like a coward last time."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060609",
                    "speaker": "Abyss Herald",
                    "text": "Our Highness's will must be done. All interferences must be removed... whatever the price to pay."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060610",
                    "speaker": "Abyss Herald",
                    "text": "This time... the curse that torments our people must be undone, once and for all."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060611",
                    "speaker": "Dainsleif",
                    "text": "You are the only ones who torment them."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060612",
                    "speaker": "Dainsleif",
                    "text": "There is nothing else left of those hilichurls. Nothing besides the curse itself."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060613",
                    "speaker": "Abyss Herald",
                    "text": "Say what you wish. I am going nowhere, Dainsleif."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060614",
                    "speaker": "Dainsleif",
                    "text": "Then you will give your life just to delay the inevitable? How absurd. But since you wish to persist, then so be it!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "800607",
            "objective": "Defeat the Abyss Herald",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "800608",
            "objective": "Talk to Dainsleif",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "80060801",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Whew! You've been hunting this Abyss Herald for aaages — now you finally got him!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060802",
                    "speaker": "Dainsleif",
                    "text": "There's no time to celebrate. The Abyss Order's device is activating, but there's still time to destroy it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80060803",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Alright! Let's go!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "800620",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "80062001",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "There's even a bonfire here, like what hilichurls build in the wild."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80062002",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Wait, but wasn't Dain saying that hilichurls get scared of the light when they reach the very end of their lives...?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "80062003",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Hmm, maybe in the very, very end, they still want to feel some light and warmth? Uh... just thinking aloud here, could also be another reason!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "800621",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "80062101",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Hilichurls usually store food in crates like these, right?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "80062102",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "But... these seem pretty much empty. Is it because they're so near to the end that they don't need to eat anymore?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "80062103",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Hmm... Even if they don't need to eat anymore, Paimon bets they still miss food for the flavor."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "800622",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "80062201",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Seems like... these hilichurls have no life left in them at all. Before long, they'll become one with the darkness."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80062202",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "The hilichurls we meet in the wild are always so rowdy... Paimon never would have imagined that this is how they spend their final days."
                },
                {
                    "id": "80062203",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "We may not have a whole lot of happy memories dealing with hilichurls, but still, Paimon hopes they're at peace in their last moments."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "800699",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "80069901",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "There are more signs of hilichurl activity here."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}